<title>USA: Stafford Cty USD 349, Kan., won by Country Club.</title>
<headline>Stafford Cty USD 349, Kan., won by Country Club.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Country Club Bank said it won $3.700 million of Stafford Cty USD 349, Kan., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.49 percent.</p>
</text>
